      { q: 'Do you offer OEM / ODM?', a: 'Yes. Our in-house design team (5+ designers, 12+ years average experience) supports both OEM (your design, our production) and ODM (our design, your brand). Tech-pack development free for orders above 500 pcs.' },
      { q: 'What is your defect tolerance / QC standard?', a: 'AQL 2.5 sampling per ISO 2859-1. Critical defects: 0%. Major defects: under 0.5%. Minor: under 1%. Each order goes through pre-shipment inspection plus optional mid-production yarn check for orders above 2,000 pcs.' },
      { q: 'What certifications do you hold?', a: 'ISO 9001:2015, OEKO-TEX Standard 100 (Class I for infant and adult skin contact), BSCI, Sedex SMETA. GOTS, RWS, and GCS (Good Cashmere Standard) available on request for orders above 1,000 pcs.' },
      { q: 'How do you ensure cashmere origin traceability?', a: 'Each batch ships with a Certificate of Origin and OFDA 2000 micron test report. For Alashan Grade A and Ordos Arbas protected-designation batches, we provide herder cooperative agreement + GPS coordinates of source pasture.' },
